{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00321",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 5.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Right, morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.11,
      "end_seconds": 10.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "So, not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 14.44,
      "end_seconds": 19.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.25,
      "end_seconds": 26.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.64,
      "end_seconds": 33.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Um, so... a sore throat a while back. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.63,
      "end_seconds": 38.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "right, tell me what you take day to day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 39.51,
      "end_seconds": 42.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "She takes escitalopram, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.38,
      "end_seconds": 45.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 47.02,
      "end_seconds": 48.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "it's 10 milligrams"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.69,
      "end_seconds": 55.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "How long have you had it? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.66,
      "end_seconds": 62.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Around about three months... no wait, it's more like two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.19,
      "end_seconds": 66.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "right anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.86,
      "end_seconds": 78.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Itching all over goes along with it, most of the time. I've also been feeling feverish in the evenings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.0,
      "end_seconds": 83.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "how would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.13,
      "end_seconds": 95.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.01,
      "text": "Maybe a four out of ten on a bad day. The itching all over? That's been since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.1,
      "end_seconds": 108.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Have you had any lumps elsewhere or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.03,
      "end_seconds": 113.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "no, no lumps elsewhere or cough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.44,
      "end_seconds": 120.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "have you had any difficulty swallowing, weight loss or pain in the lump?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.58,
      "end_seconds": 123.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.93,
      "end_seconds": 126.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.13,
      "end_seconds": 129.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.57,
      "end_seconds": 136.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.84,
      "end_seconds": 143.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "yes, latex i get a rash on my hands"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.4,
      "end_seconds": 152.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.7,
      "end_seconds": 156.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "I have depression, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.54,
      "end_seconds": 162.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Yes, depression is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.62,
      "end_seconds": 176.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.63,
      "end_seconds": 196.28,
      "duration_seconds": 18.65,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest. I used to smoke but I quit five years ago. Yes, I'm a nurse on a busy ward. I cycle to work most mornings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.25,
      "end_seconds": 201.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Is there a family history of anything significant?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.15,
      "end_seconds": 207.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "my father had a heart attack"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.59,
      "end_seconds": 211.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "let me measure a few things"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.72,
      "end_seconds": 219.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Almost there..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.87,
      "end_seconds": 239.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "okay: respiratory rate 18, temperature 36.4. And BP is 109 over 71, pulse 65."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.03,
      "end_seconds": 242.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.39,
      "end_seconds": 247.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "let's look at it together in a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.55,
      "end_seconds": 252.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, bear with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.24,
      "end_seconds": 257.94,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.03,
      "end_seconds": 261.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.62,
      "end_seconds": 279.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "There's a firm, mobile lump about two centimetres under the left jaw, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.17,
      "end_seconds": 282.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "bear with me a second"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.93,
      "end_seconds": 299.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "I can't feel other glands in the neck, armpits or groin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.7,
      "end_seconds": 320.63,
      "duration_seconds": 18.93,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. Taking everything into account, it's hard to say. A reactive lymph node after a throat infection is one possibility and something that needs a tissue diagnosis another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.29,
      "end_seconds": 327.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.38,
      "end_seconds": 339.16,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a reactive lymph node after a throat infection, and we'll watch how it goes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.86,
      "end_seconds": 355.87,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "alright, for now, no new medicines or tests are needed. Take care, and call us if anything changes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 356.41,
      "end_seconds": 361.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "I think that's clear. Thank you for being so thorough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.72,
      "end_seconds": 363.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}